Today is Saturday.
It is morning time.
I am at my neighbourhood café.
There is a lot of crowd here today.
Many people are inside.
The wonderful aroma of fresh coffee comes.
I want to meet new people.
So I am learning to work here.
Today is my first day here.
This is my first volunteer shift.
Therefore, I am a little nervous.
But I am also excited.
I push open the café door.
I enter inside.
There is a large counter there.
Today I am working behind the counter.
I am ready for the new experience.
